WEBVTT

00:19:28.788 --> 00:19:31.060
Businesses of America need to support

00:19:31.084 --> 00:19:33.916
Mrs. Obama to do the things
that she wants to do.

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:40.339
(Applause)

00:19:40.363 --> 00:19:42.309
And look, I know it's weird

00:19:42.333 --> 00:19:44.916
having an English person
standing here before you

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:46.381
talking about all this.

00:19:46.405 --> 00:19:47.753
All I can say is: I care.

00:19:48.309 --> 00:19:49.731
I'm a father,

00:19:49.755 --> 00:19:51.096
and I love this country.

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:54.542
And I believe truly, actually,

00:19:54.566 --> 00:19:57.415
that if change can be made
in this country,

00:19:57.439 --> 00:19:59.622
beautiful things will happen
around the world.

00:19:59.646 --> 00:20:01.781
If America does it,
other people will follow.